{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is SokoChess Black?</h2>SokoChess Black is a unique chess puzzle game in which you must use your wits to navigate each level, moving, pushing and capturing white pieces until there are none left.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture the white pieces</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482820/extras/b2b87780df4f0068d6d6042165ceb763.poster.avif?t=1757579801\" width=400 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482820/extras/b2b87780df4f0068d6d6042165ceb763.webm?t=1757579801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482820/extras/b2b87780df4f0068d6d6042165ceb763.mp4?t=1757579801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The goal of each level is to capture all the white pieces.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Move and push your own pieces</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482820/extras/e4e3292bf8e049a8e7939e4c47f41076.poster.avif?t=1757579801\" width=400 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482820/extras/e4e3292bf8e049a8e7939e4c47f41076.webm?t=1757579801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482820/extras/e4e3292bf8e049a8e7939e4c47f41076.mp4?t=1757579801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can move your own pieces but also push them to make them move in a way they normally couldn't.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beyond Chess</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482820/extras/ef77605c0734b47a077e47ec68f3a7eb.poster.avif?t=1757579801\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482820/extras/ef77605c0734b47a077e47ec68f3a7eb.webm?t=1757579801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482820/extras/ef77605c0734b47a077e47ec68f3a7eb.mp4?t=1757579801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Overcome many unique obstacles before unseen in Chess!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482820/extras/f07a4af4500ac67319d6dfaa42a53ebc.avif?t=1757579801\" width=620 height=85 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 70 handcrafted levels<br></li><li> Infinite undos<br></li><li> Puzzle elements you won't see in Chess<br></li><li> Don't like a level you are playing? Skip it!<br></li><li> Unique gameplay combining Chess and Sokoban</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience Chess like never before!</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Black Pawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482820/85c4b772e9b17654470987cb66774aed9ace51ed.jpg"},{"name":"Black Knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482820/0dcfa5f2694232bfae1e2ff8c481c0f56ebf26b6.jpg"},{"name":"Black Bishop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482820/b9267f06e9bcf82e93e415f2231ec7ecffc5e98e.jpg"},{"name":"Black Rook","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482820/c35703908938c21d2706eb40817a068e5e66e4c8.jpg"},{"name":"Black Queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482820/f7af70cc6c99f68afecabc59cbd7af78562e7318.jpg"},{"name":"Black King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482820/19285321bf2a868fe3f4f522d31dcf23d9f6bdbb.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Master","path":